      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "About My Wife"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My wife is a housewife."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We met for the first time fifteen years ago, and later we married."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My wife is very supportive of me and always takes great care of my family and me."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She likes to visit with her friends when she has time."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She always helps the children with their homework and encourages them to study hard."
